 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "另有一类风险，根本不在合约里。",
   "spoken": "另有一类风险，根本不在合约里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "稳定币和代币化的现实资产，把链下资产带上了链。",
   "spoken": "稳定币和代币化的现实资产，把链下资产带上了链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.132,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 5.23,
   "speechEnd": 9.158
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "它们值多少，不看合约代码，看链下的储备，赎回，和发行方的权限。",
   "spoken": "它们值多少，不看合约代码，看链下的储备，赎回，和发行方的权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.2,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 10.298,
   "speechEnd": 15.917
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "打个比方。稳定币像一张银行开的提货单。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。稳定币像一张银航开的提货单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.972,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 17.07,
   "speechEnd": 20.674
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "提货单印得再精美，只要仓库里的货不够，仓库被封，或者银行能随时作废它，它就不值一美元。",
   "spoken": "提货单印得再精美，只要仓库里的货不够，仓库被封，或者银航能随时作废它，它就不值一美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.728,
   "dur": 8.136,
   "speechStart": 21.826,
   "speechEnd": 29.052
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立：作废提货单，要走法律程序。冻结或销毁一个地址上的代币，通常只要一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立：作废提货单，要走法律程序。冻结或销毁一个地址上的代币，通常只要一笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.084,
   "dur": 8.904,
   "speechStart": 30.182,
   "speechEnd": 38.144
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "DeFi 协议拿它做抵押品，就继承了这些链下风险。",
   "spoken": "DeFi 协议拿它做抵押品，就继承了这些链下风险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 39.208,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 39.306,
   "speechEnd": 42.937
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "风险分五类。第一类，储备与托管。",
   "spoken": "风险分五类。第一类，储备与托管。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 43.988,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 44.086,
   "speechEnd": 47.464
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月，按 Circle 的声明，约 33 亿美元储备存在倒闭的硅谷银行。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月，按 Circle 的声明，约 33 亿美元储备存在倒闭的硅谷银航。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 48.528,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 48.626,
   "speechEnd": 54.447
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "按 The Block 报道，USDC 最低跌到约 0.87 美元。以它为主要抵押的 DAI，也跌到约 0.90 美元。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 报道，USDC 最低跌到约 0.87 美元。以它为主要抵押的 DAI，也跌到约 0.90 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 55.516,
   "dur": 8.712,
   "speechStart": 55.614,
   "speechEnd": 63.397
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第二类，设计缺陷。2022 年 5 月，算法稳定币 Terra UST 挤兑，进入死亡螺旋，约 400 亿美元市值蒸发。",
   "spoken": "第二类，设计缺陷。2022 年 5 月，算法稳定币 Terra UST 挤兑，进入死亡螺旋，约 400 亿美元市值蒸发。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 64.448,
   "dur": 10.008,
   "speechStart": 64.546,
   "speechEnd": 73.615
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第三类，铸币权限。",
   "spoken": "第三类，铸币权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 74.676,
   "dur": 2.688,
   "speechStart": 74.774,
   "speechEnd": 76.512
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2026 年 3 月，Resolv 被凭空铸出约 8000 万枚 USR。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 3 月，Resolv 被凭空铸出约 8000 万枚 USR。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 77.584,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 77.682,
   "speechEnd": 82.265
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "按 QuillAudits 和 CertiK 的分析，攻击者拿到了铸币密钥，合约也不核对铸币量和存入资产的比例。",
   "spoken": "按 QuillAudits 和 CertiK 的分析，攻击者拿到了铸币密钥，合约也不核对铸币量和存入资产的比例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 83.324,
   "dur": 8.208,
   "speechStart": 83.422,
   "speechEnd": 90.684
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "2026 年 5 月的 StablR，三个签名人里任意一人，就能批准铸币。拿下一个人，就拿下了全部。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 5 月的 StablR，三个签名人里任意一人，就能批准铸币。拿下一个人，就拿下了全部。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 91.752,
   "dur": 8.4,
   "speechStart": 91.85,
   "speechEnd": 99.3
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "第四类，链下策略。2025 年 11 月，Stream Finance 的一名外部基金管理人，亏掉约 9300 万美元，提款随即冻结。",
   "spoken": "第四类，链下策略。2025 年 11 月，Stream Finance 的一名外部基金管理人，亏掉约 9300 万美元，提款随即冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 100.372,
   "dur": 10.176,
   "speechStart": 100.47,
   "speechEnd": 109.717
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "第五类，定价来源。2025 年 10 月 10 日，USDe 只在 Binance 现货，跌到约 0.65 美元。",
   "spoken": "第五类，定价来源。2025 年 10 月 10 日，USDe 只在 Binance 现货，跌到约 0.65 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 110.768,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 110.866,
   "speechEnd": 118.089
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "链上和其他交易所，基本保持在约 0.90 美元以上。",
   "spoken": "链上和其他交易所，基本保持在约 0.90 美元以上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 119.148,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 119.246,
   "speechEnd": 123.317
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "Binance 用自家订单簿给抵押品估值，触发了用户清算，之后赔付约 2.83 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "Binance 用自家订单簿给抵押品估值，触发了用户清算，之后赔付约 2.83 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 124.384,
   "dur": 7.416,
   "speechStart": 124.482,
   "speechEnd": 130.946
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "风险会沿着抵押关系往下传。储备一出问题，所有拿它做抵押品的协议，同时受影响。",
